@startuml
title Add a player to a roster
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Administrator submits player, jersey,\nand voter details;
:Route checks Administrator and validates JSON;
if (Team active and Registration window open?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Reject;
  stop
endif
if (Player exists and profile is active?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Reject;
  stop
endif
:Normalize jersey number;
if (Already on team or another active team\nin same sport and season?) then (yes)
  :Reject;
  stop
else (no)
endif
if (Jersey used or roster at maximum?) then (yes)
  :Reject;
  stop
else (no)
endif
if (Player is 18 or older today?) then (yes)
  if (Voter verified and number supplied?) then (yes)
    :Create or update season eligibility record;
  else (no)
    :Reject;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
endif
:Create roster link;
:Commit roster and eligibility changes;
:Refresh roster and available-player queries;
stop
legend bottom
  Adult voter details are required on every add request;
  there is no independent voter-registration lookup.
  Gender eligibility is not currently enforced.
endlegend
@enduml
